    BRANCH
        IF `an application has been made, or an appeal taken, under section 490 in respect of the thing or the proceeding in which the right of seizure thereof is questioned, and is pending` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the day in question` AT LEAST `the day an order in respect of the thing is made` AND `the day in question` AT MOST `s 490(12) the last day of the thirty days after the order` `the day an order in respect of the thing is made` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

