GIVEN `the lawful owner was not a party to an offence in relation to the thing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the identity of the lawful owner cannot be reasonably ascertained` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 490.01(b)(i) what becomes of the proceeds of disposition`
`s 490.01(b)(i) the proceeds of disposition` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the identity of the lawful owner cannot be reasonably ascertained` THEN JUST `s 490.01(b)(i) the proceeds are forfeited to Her Majesty`
        IF `the lawful owner was not a party to an offence in relation to the thing` THEN JUST `s 490.01(b)(i) the proceeds are given to the lawful owner of the thing seized`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent)
